Run a Sounio program using the interpreter

Usage: souc run [OPTIONS] <FILE> [ARGS]...

Arguments:
  <FILE>     Input file
  [ARGS]...  Arguments to pass to the program

Options:
      --use-sounio-compiler  Deprecated compatibility flag: self-hosted compiler is now the default for `run`
      --trace-interp         Emit interpreter execution trace to stderr
      --check-only           Run a type-check pass before execution
  -v, --verbose              Enable verbose output
  -h, --help                 Print help
